type: software
title: "BrillouinAcquisition (fork)"
abstract: >-
  Software for the acquisition of Brillouin microscopy data (Windows, C++/Qt). Modified fork of BrillouinAcquisition by the BrillouinAcquisition contributors, released under the GNU General Public License v3.0. The
  modifications by Niklas Gampl are documented in the CHANGELOG and the commit history.
